May require:

maintenance manual (vector DB)
downtime statistics (warehouse)
3. Security

Your RBAC answer was good.

But at the architect level I'd add:

The LLM should only retrieve data that the user is authorized to access.

For example:

Manager A
     ↓
Can see Plant A data

Manager B
     ↓
Can see Plant B data

The retrieval layer must enforce that.

Otherwise the AI becomes a data-leak system.

